{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"12baf83f738d213fc8fcfdfb80ed9077bac361d38fc0165824d98cb7b59e53b9","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":42,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["聖殿附近的兩座屋子"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["他帶我出來向北，到外院，又帶我進入聖屋；這聖屋一排順着空地，一排與北邊鋪石地之屋相對。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["這聖屋長一百肘，寬五十肘，有向北的門。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["對着內院那二十肘寬之空地，又對着外院的鋪石地，在第三層樓上有樓廊對着樓廊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["在聖屋前有一條夾道，寬十肘，長一百肘。房門都向北。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["聖屋因為樓廊佔去些地方，所以上層比中下兩層窄些。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["聖屋有三層，卻無柱子，不像外院的屋子有柱子；所以上層比中下兩層更窄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["聖屋外，東邊有牆，靠着外院，長五十肘。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["靠着外院的聖屋長五十肘。殿北面的聖屋長一百肘。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["在聖屋以下，東頭有進入之處，就是從外院進入之處。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["向南",{"noteId":46},"在內院牆裏有聖屋，一排與鋪石地之屋相對，一排順着空地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["這聖屋前的夾道與北邊聖屋的夾道長寬一樣；出入之處與北屋門的樣式相同。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["正在牆前、夾道的東頭，有門可以進入，與向南聖屋的門一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他對我說：「順着空地的南屋北屋，都是聖屋；親近耶和華的祭司當在那裏吃至聖的物，也當在那裏放至聖的物，就是素祭、贖罪祭，和贖愆祭，因此處為聖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["祭司進去出了聖所的時候，不可直到外院，但要在聖屋放下他們供職的衣服，因為是聖衣；要穿上別的衣服才可以到屬民的外院。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["聖殿周圍的尺寸"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["他量完了內殿，就帶我出朝東的門，量院的四圍。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他用量度的竿量四圍，量東面五百肘",{"noteId":47},"，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["用竿量北面五百肘，"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["用竿量南面五百肘，"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["又轉到西面，用竿量五百肘。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["他量四面，四圍有牆，長五百肘，寬五百肘，為要分別聖地與俗地。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":46,"caller":"-","text":"原文是東","reference":{"chapter":42,"verse":10}},{"noteId":47,"caller":"-","text":"原文是竿；本章下同","reference":{"chapter":42,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/42.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/43.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/41.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}